My childhood diary that I found on my bed
[background scene="res://scenes/dialogues/DialogicBackgroundScene.tscn" arg="res://assets/cgs/CG_Notebook.png" fade="0.5" wait="true"]
When I open it, I realize there's only one single page left inside
...
[b]"My Favorite Games."[/b]
[b][i]Elemental Shift[/i][/b]\
[i][font_size=14]Oh, I used to play this game every single day the second I got home from school! The scope of the story is just massive, and the characters are absolutely incredible. Honestly, I still dream about waking up in that world[/font_size][/i]
[b][i]Beacon of Light[/i][/b]\
[i][font_size=14]Everyone was giving this game nines and tens across the board. That's the only reason I bought it. Talk about the biggest disappointment of my life[/font_size][/i]
[b][i]Soaring in the sky[/i][/b]\
[i][font_size=14]Whoa, where did this cartridge even come from? I think I got it bundled together with [b]Beacon of Light[/b]. So, yeah, I might have gotten two games for the price of one, but all I really got was double the disappointment.[/font_size][/i]
[b][i]Orange[/i][/b]\
[i][font_size=14]I never actually finished this one. It looks like the most harmless, innocent game in the world, but in reality...[input] I feel like it completely ruined my life![/font_size][/i]
[b][i]Step ahead[/i][/b]\
[i][font_size=14]My favorite character is Ann! We share the same name! To be honest, though, the arcade mode got old real quick.[/font_size][/i]
[b][i]Sweet Memories[/i][/b]\
[i][font_size=14]My sister and I played through this one together. When it first came out, it was just too brutal to figure out on your own... But now?[input] Now I absolutely adore it.[/font_size][/i]